---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Keero Bot | Jaksa Tomovic"
  description="Keero Bot is a modular voice-first robotics platform built around ESP32-S3, local audio intelligence, and extensible hardware modules."
>
  <section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-primary/70 dark:text-white/70 sm:tracking-[0.35em]">Hardware Lab</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">
          Keero Bot
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 sm:text-lg">
          A modular, voice-first robotics platform built on ESP32-S3. Keero Bot combines local audio intelligence,
          expressive state logic, and practical module expansion into one focused hardware system.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/hardware"
          class="mt-7 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:bg-white dark:text-primary dark:hover:bg-white/90 sm:w-auto"
        >
          Open hardware page
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M5 12h14" />
            <path d="M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-primary/10 bg-white/85 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-primary/5 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-secondary/70 sm:p-7">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary dark:text-white">Build focus</h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 sm:text-base">
          <li>ESP32-S3 compute and audio base layer</li>
          <li>Local-first voice and behavior runtime</li>
          <li>Extensible sensor, motion, and interaction modules</li>
          <li>Firmware architecture designed for long-term iteration</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
